### 1. 注册（正常）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "test01", "password": "123456", "confirmPassword": "123456", "nickname": "测试一"}

### 2. 注册（用户名已存在 → 400）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "demo", "password": "123456", "confirmPassword": "123456"}

### 3. 注册（两次密码不一致 → 400）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "test02", "password": "123456", "confirmPassword": "654321"}

### 4. 注册（用户名格式非法 → 400）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "ab", "password": "123456", "confirmPassword": "123456"}

### 5. 登录（无该用户 → 404）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "nobody", "password": "123456"}

### 6. 登录（密码错误 → 400）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "demo", "password": "wrong"}

### 7. 登录（成功 → 200）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "demo", "password": "123456"}

### 8. 查询已注册用户（第 10 步才写，现在会 500/404，属正常）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/test/users
